  (text "NOTA 1: Pinout U1 verificado no datasheet oficial Fanstel BM832A Ver 1.04 (nRF52810):"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "26ba08db-82f0-488c-8816-e364f1350b6f")
  )
  (text "  GND=pino 1, VDD=pino 14, P0.21/RST=pino 40 (NC), SWDCLK=pino 42, SWDIO=pino 43."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4940d8a0-2206-4ba9-9114-25188f233aa2")
  )
  (text "  Demais pinos do modulo (47 LGA) nao usados pelo firmware -> NC explicito no eschematico."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ba687973-f853-4ce5-9a08-e35a85a2094b")
  )
  (text "  Fonte: tabela de pinos do datasheet Fanstel BM832A Ver 1.04 p.7."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 205.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9704bca3-67fb-449d-b1fd-913e687d7318")
  )
  (text "NOTA 2: Desacoplo (DEC) e DC/DC integrados ao modulo BM832A, sem conexao externa;"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 210.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a04f399a-bc4a-4a9b-948b-20d5116bcd54")
  )
  (text "  datasheet do modulo nao exige componente externo (BOM_smartbadge_v2 nao lista nenhum)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 215.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "857509b3-4ef5-4cc0-94a3-1c7429b9ff7e")
  )
  (text "NOTA 3: GPIOs P0.02-P0.31, P0.18 e P0.21/RST nao usados pelo firmware -> NC explicito."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 220.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e38d075c-9d9d-4c39-9f65-ef10d590399e")
  )
  (text "NOTA 4: Layout: antena PCB integrada do BM832A (lado do pino 1) exige overhang de 4,4 mm"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6e685e1a-5928-498d-bd03-9648eab42142")
  )
  (text "  alem da borda do plano GND da PCB (datasheet Fanstel Ver 1.04 p.11); ferrite SHLD1 entre BT1 e a bobina NFC TAG1; PCB 2"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 231.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6b8b70af-0273-4410-a357-61a4c3de8a8c")
  )
  (text "  camadas 0,8 mm, plano GND contiguo. Antena interna: nenhuma rede Pi externa."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "388b09b8-6867-4ddd-ae51-f1596752a3ac")
  )
  (text "NOTA 5: ANATEL: item aberto (modulo possui FCC/CE/TELEC/SRRC/KC/NCC). Alimentacao CR2032"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8242bf50-ca55-4564-92a8-1a6ff1dfa72b")
  )
  (text "  3,0V -> 2,0V direto em VCC (modulo aceita 1,8-3,6V, sem LDO interno)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 246.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "69b158fa-c80a-47db-a12b-081871b00972")
  )
  (text "NOTA 6: libs/nibas_wristband.kicad_sym (fonte) tem sintaxe rejeitada pelo parser de"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 251.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "228a40db-6c22-4308-adbd-2f53e7158d63")
  )
  (text "  esquemático do KiCad 10 (effects a nivel de pino; justify center). Copia corrigida em"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 256.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "44a604ea-d3b6-4f45-b465-72cfe1852530")
  )
  (text "  libs/ local do projeto (pins inalterados); correcao upstream pendente (fora deste passo)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 261.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5edb760a-ae43-453b-8fca-e23448e8a532")
  )
  (text "NOTA 7: ERC: regra pin_not_driven = ignore (projeto): unico pino input e SWDCLK (pino 42),"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 266.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b41046f2-a263-4b8a-b8ff-2648c4f6e0c2")
  )
  (text "  acionado pelo programador SWD externo durante gravacao; sem driver a bordo por design."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 271.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4b162d63-ae13-42cc-9e49-885773990804")
  )
  (text "NOTA 8: ERC: regra footprint_link_issues = ignore (projeto): o kicad-cli 10.0.6 nao carrega"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 276.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "54d65e49-e744-41f7-a31d-92ea276866b7")
  )
  (text "  o fp-lib-table do projeto (verificado: com/sem tabela o resultado e identico); os 4"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 281.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
